menu "Kiosk screen"

    config UI_ENROL_NAME
        string "Name the board button enrols under"
        default "Nhân viên 1"
        help
            The enrol screen of E10-T7 replaces this. Until it exists the board
            button is the only way to add a face, and NVS key device/enrol_name
            overrides this at run time.

endmenu
